                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tipo pa Rwoth Yehova ni i wia; kum Yehova wira kara ayer rwonglembe ma ber ni ju ma mol; eora kara acang cwiny ju m’utur, kara ayer pi gony ni ng’eca, man pi yabu dhu kol ni ju ma jutwio; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 5:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara ayer pi rundi mi bero pa Yehova, man ceng’ mi culokwor pa Mungu mwa; kara ajuk dhanu ceke m’uywak; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara ang’ol ni ju m’uywak i Sayuni, kara ami igi jambruko ka vuru, man mo mi mutoro ka ywak, man kendi mi pak kar adieng’acwiny; kara julwong’gi yen mi bedopwe, girapidha pa Yehova, kara juyunge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gibigomo uvuru ma con, man gibiting’o ka m’unyothre ma kwong’a, man gibiyiko adhura m’umor, ka m’unyothre ni dhanum’utuk dupa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man juwirok bicungo man gibikwayu udul rombe mu, man juwirok bibedo ni jufur mu ku julwer kum ulok mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento jubilwong’owu julam pa Yehova; dhanu bilwong’owu jutim pa Mungu mwa: wubicamu lonyo mi thek, man wubilulu giwu ni kum dwong’ migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubibedo ku piny wang’ ario ka lewic mu; man anyong’a binegogi ni kum makapiny migi ka cac: ka kumeno gibibedo ku piny wang’ ario i ng’om migi; mutoro mi nja bibedo igi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum an, an a Yehova, amaru pokolembe, adagu ayeki ku kier; man abimio cul migi igi i lemandha, man abitimo lembariba mi nja kugi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jubing’eyo kodhigi i kind thek, man nyikwaigi i kind kodhidhanu: dhanu ceke m’unenogi bing’eyogi, nia gi kodhi ma Yehova mio mugisa igi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
